{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierSemisimple","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierSemisimple","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierEquiv","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeSemisimpleGeneral"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.isSemisimpleRing_iwahoriHecke_of_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.isSemisimpleRing_iwahoriHecke_of_sq","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeCarrierSemisimple.lean#L47-L53","doc":"**The same, at an Iwahori parameter `Q` that is given as a square.**  The shape a caller\nholding `Q` wants, once it can exhibit a square root. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.isSemisimpleRing_iwahoriHecke_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.isSemisimpleRing_iwahoriHecke_sq","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeCarrierSemisimple.lean#L33-L45","doc":"**`QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke K (q ^ 2) n` is semisimple, over any field of characteristic\nzero with `q` not a root of unity, at every rank.**\n\nThe `T_w` / `twGram` carrier, general-field.  Transported from\n`isSemisimpleRing_hecke_generic` along `skeinIwahoriEquiv`.\n\nStated at `q ^ 2` rather than at a general Iwahori parameter `Q` because naming a `q` with\n`q ^ 2 = Q` is exactly what a general field cannot do; see the module docstring. ","signatureChunk":0}]}